     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "两个柜子中间的墙上挂着灭火器和灭火毯。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "70148588",
    "50148056"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/16/cd/16cd176ecc883060f2d6b4bdc8e3caa9.jpeg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/16/cd/16cd176ecc883060f2d6b4bdc8e3caa9.jpeg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>1.大部分家庭火灾都源自洗手间或厨房。</strong>所以为了安全起见，可以在洗手间或厨房附近放一个灭火器和灭火毯备用。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "卧室的墙边立着一个抽屉柜。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "30354660"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/8a/4c/8a4cbc45343b097fa604350f883185d8.jpeg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/8a/4c/8a4cbc45343b097fa604350f883185d8.jpeg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "特写：一个抽屉柜牢牢地固定在卧室的墙上。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/79/30/79305e63c8e74091f4f9c6c3e5790a5a.jpeg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/79/30/79305e63c8e74091f4f9c6c3e5790a5a.jpeg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>2.&nbsp;摆放好的抽屉柜，或许看上去已经十分稳固安全，</strong>但是也可能存在安全隐患。为求稳妥，请务必把抽屉柜固定到墙上。（我们的所有工作人员上门时，都自带必备工具。）</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "靠近床和踏脚凳的墙顶安着一个烟雾探测器。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "20281886"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/d8/36/d83651a7be4f5a34affa396ac538602f.jpeg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/d8/36/d83651a7be4f5a34affa396ac538602f.jpeg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>3.有时候，烟雾探测器可以救人一命。</strong>真的。在家中安装几个烟雾探测器，尤其需要安在卧室里，你可以站在踏脚凳上，再把它固定到墙上（这样会比安在天花板上更容易够得着）。新的一年开始了，是时候换下旧电池、换上新电池了。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "楼梯的每一个台阶上都安装了防滑条。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "00175599"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/d9/63/d9632dd96fe29b0269a1b7b02731ddf5.jpeg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/d9/63/d9632dd96fe29b0269a1b7b02731ddf5.jpeg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "80310225"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/08/96/0896e2ea734ed1ddcb45d961a3cf31a9.jpeg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/08/96/0896e2ea734ed1ddcb45d961a3cf31a9.jpeg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>4.楼梯上，浴室里……</strong>很多地方都存在滑倒的危险。在楼梯上安装防滑条，在淋浴地面或浴缸里铺上防滑垫，就可以降低摔倒的几率。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "客厅里，一块地毯卷起来，露出下面的地毯防滑垫。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "40227879"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/88/46/88469e5ca5eddbc207bc5b39ffee4ef4.jpeg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/88/46/88469e5ca5eddbc207bc5b39ffee4ef4.jpeg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>5.地毯防滑垫</strong>可以很好地固定住地毯，人走在上面就不容易滑倒。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "狗狗试图推开一扇安了窗搭钩的窗子。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "30175606"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/78/ea/78ea4059f5a2c58ea88c224c50f56b07.jpeg"
