     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "狗狗试图推开一扇安了窗搭钩的窗子。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "30283106"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/0f/a5/0fa501f0365617602c0187a9d7b2af22.jpeg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/0f/a5/0fa501f0365617602c0187a9d7b2af22.jpeg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>6.让麻烦和危险离家里的宠物和孩子远点</strong>，你只需要安全门挡和窗搭钩（另外，再也不用担心夹到手指了）。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "橱柜旁的厨房墙壁上挂着一个红色药柜。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "10262100"
   ],
   "images": [
